## Validation Checklist

- [ ] Image files validated for type (JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF) and size (max 5MB) before upload
- [ ] CSV files validated for size (max 10MB) and proper encoding (UTF-8)
- [ ] JSON templates validated against expected schema version before import
- [ ] CSV parser handles quoted fields, escaped quotes, and newlines within fields
- [ ] Export filenames include quiz ID and timestamp for uniqueness
- [ ] Template import creates quiz in "draft" status — never auto-publish imported content
- [ ] Template import strips all IDs — new CUIDs generated for all records
- [ ] Bulk upload processes in batches of 5 to respect Shopify API rate limits
- [ ] File upload errors return descriptive messages to the merchant UI
- [ ] No file content is stored in the app database — only CDN URLs are persisted
